==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*kooldak}}, from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*kale-}}.<ref>{{R:fi:EVE|kuolla|accessdate=2024-01-01}}</ref> Cognates include {{cog|myv|куломс}}, {{cog|mns-nor|хо̄луӈкве}} and {{cog|hu|hal}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p|*}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}

# {{lb|fi|intransitive}} to [[die]] {{+obj|fi|ill<of/from>}}
#: {{syn|fi|Thesaurus:kuolla}}
#: {{coi|fi|olla '''kuolemaisillaan'''|to be '''at the point of death'''}}
#: {{ux|fi|Isoäitini '''kuoli''' syöpään.|My grandmother '''died''' of cancer.}}
#: {{ux|fi|'''Kuolen''' nälkään.|I'll '''starve''' to death.|lit=I'll '''die''' of hunger.}}

